From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Antheas Kapenekakis <lkml@antheas.dev>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 01:35:06 +0200
Subject: platform/x86: lenovo-wmi-other: Add charge type control

Some Lenovo Legion devices expose an 80% battery charge limit through
Other Mode WMI attribute 0x03010001. Extend ACPI batteries with the
standard charge_types power supply property and translate Standard and
Long Life to the firmware values used by this interface.

Only register the extension when capability data reports readable
support, honor the advertised write capability, and defer to
ideapad_laptop when its native conservation-mode methods are available.

Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5.6-sol
Signed-off-by: Antheas Kapenekakis <lkml@antheas.dev>
